@host=http://localhost:3001

### Health Check
GET {{host}}/health

### Get All Prices
GET {{host}}/prices

### Get Single Token Price
GET {{host}}/prices/BNB

### Get Single Token Price (not found)
GET {{host}}/prices/DOGE

### Get Price History (default limit)
GET {{host}}/prices/BTC/history

### Get Price History (custom limit)
GET {{host}}/prices/BTC/history?limit=5

### SSE Stream (all tokens)
GET {{host}}/events

### SSE Stream (filtered)
GET {{host}}/events?tokens=BTC,ETH
